00:04:25.449 --> 00:04:26.610
- Don't become like a cult,

00:04:26.610 --> 00:04:28.976
like don't just like me.

00:04:28.976 --> 00:04:30.586
Be a fan of everyone.

00:04:30.586 --> 00:04:32.822
You can like Rihanna's
music and mine and Gaga's,

00:04:32.822 --> 00:04:33.794
it's okay.

00:04:33.794 --> 00:04:34.752
You don't have to be like,

00:04:34.752 --> 00:04:36.225
"I'm a Jessie J. Fan (growls)."

00:04:36.225 --> 00:04:37.161
(laughter)

00:04:37.161 --> 00:04:37.994
You know.

00:04:37.994 --> 00:04:40.396
My mom and dad would never
let me put posters on the wall

00:04:40.396 --> 00:04:41.376
because they were like,

00:04:41.376 --> 00:04:42.369
"Be you, be inspired,

00:04:42.369 --> 00:04:44.285
"but don't become anyone else."

00:04:44.285 --> 00:04:47.617
Which is why I think as an
artist I wasn't very, very,

00:04:47.617 --> 00:04:49.364
the one thing that I was very proud of

00:04:49.364 --> 00:04:52.413
was when I first came out that
no one compared me to anyone.

00:04:52.413 --> 00:04:53.930
I think you can tell when someone's

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:55.656
idolized somebody sometimes.

00:04:55.656 --> 00:04:58.005
And I think it's good to be inspired,

00:04:58.005 --> 00:05:00.344
but don't become somebody.

00:05:00.344 --> 00:05:01.440
Be yourself.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:03.603
Just always be yourself.

00:05:03.603 --> 00:05:04.436
Always.

00:05:05.678 --> 00:05:06.845
Whatever people say about you,

00:05:06.845 --> 00:05:08.958
whatever people believe...

00:05:08.958 --> 00:05:10.881
That is true, that isn't about you,

00:05:10.881 --> 00:05:12.114
trust me,

00:05:12.114 --> 00:05:16.281
life is not worth living
feeling sad and down and lonely.

00:05:17.593 --> 00:05:21.082
Just always be true to who you are.

00:05:21.082 --> 00:05:22.313
- I was always the class clown,

00:05:22.313 --> 00:05:23.949
I know it's kind of weird and shitty,

00:05:23.949 --> 00:05:25.306
and it's kind of like,

00:05:25.306 --> 00:05:28.084
I've always been an outcast
because they never felt me.

00:05:28.084 --> 00:05:29.652
I know we're the outcasts,

00:05:29.652 --> 00:05:31.212
I mean if you listen to the music,

00:05:31.212 --> 00:05:32.475
or just us in general,

00:05:32.475 --> 00:05:33.431
like you met me in person,

00:05:33.431 --> 00:05:34.323
I'm just serious now,

00:05:34.323 --> 00:05:36.814
but I'm always jumping around.

00:05:36.814 --> 00:05:39.244
I'm surprised I sat down still this time.

00:05:39.244 --> 00:05:40.943
We've always been outcasts,

00:05:40.943 --> 00:05:43.185
and it's kind of cool
because this is what's

00:05:43.185 --> 00:05:45.761
going to make us great in the future.

00:05:45.761 --> 00:05:46.741
At the end of the day,

00:05:46.741 --> 00:05:49.259
throughout all the jokes
and bullshit or whatever,

00:05:49.259 --> 00:05:50.492
just always be yourself,

00:05:50.492 --> 00:05:52.031
that's the one thing that I'm like,

00:05:52.031 --> 00:05:53.110
just do it.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.975
That's what I try to tell people,

00:05:54.975 --> 00:05:57.142
just to do what they want.

00:05:58.346 --> 00:06:00.061
And that's why at the end of the day,

00:06:00.061 --> 00:06:01.993
I'm always going to make
the music I want to make.

00:06:01.993 --> 00:06:04.464
Like, people get so caught up

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:06.325
in like making their first album,

00:06:06.325 --> 00:06:08.906
like Basser like was pretty successful

00:06:08.906 --> 00:06:09.793
and people are like,

00:06:09.793 --> 00:06:11.702
"Oh shit, I hope you make
something like that."

00:06:11.702 --> 00:06:12.848
But, I can't.

00:06:12.848 --> 00:06:13.681
It's regression,

00:06:13.681 --> 00:06:15.132
I'm in a whole different mindset.

00:06:15.132 --> 00:06:16.171
I'm having a,

00:06:16.171 --> 00:06:18.559
I wasn't having that shit a year ago,

00:06:18.559 --> 00:06:21.034
so I'm going to make the
music that I want to make now,

00:06:21.034 --> 00:06:22.021
that sounds cool to me.

00:06:22.021 --> 00:06:22.854
Who knows,

00:06:22.854 --> 00:06:25.343
I might end up doing
coke and be a drug addict

00:06:25.343 --> 00:06:28.181
two years from now and making
some off the wall music.

00:06:28.181 --> 00:06:29.080
At the end of the day,

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:30.010
I'm going to fight it,

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:31.142
and I think that's one
of the main reasons why

00:06:31.142 --> 00:06:32.709
people love us,

00:06:32.709 --> 00:06:33.542
because we do what we want.

00:06:33.542 --> 00:06:36.454
- It goes back to a bit of
what Warren was saying as well,

00:06:36.454 --> 00:06:38.510
like it's the discipline as well.

00:06:38.510 --> 00:06:40.832
The discipline to not get
caught up in the moment.

00:06:40.832 --> 00:06:43.183
You know, music is like stocks, too,

00:06:43.183 --> 00:06:44.016
you know,

00:06:44.016 --> 00:06:45.773
there's the hot thing of the moment.

00:06:45.773 --> 00:06:47.491
You know, there's this hot electro sound

00:06:47.491 --> 00:06:49.423
or the hot auto tuned voice

00:06:49.423 --> 00:06:51.090
or the hot whatever,

00:06:52.311 --> 00:06:54.089
whatever is new and exciting.

00:06:54.089 --> 00:06:55.482
And you know, you know,

00:06:55.482 --> 00:06:58.524
people tend to make emotional
decisions based on that,

00:06:58.524 --> 00:07:00.237
they don't stick with what they know.

00:07:00.237 --> 00:07:01.188
This is why I am,

00:07:01.188 --> 00:07:03.191
you know, this is what I do.

00:07:03.191 --> 00:07:04.429
And then they you know,

00:07:04.429 --> 00:07:06.877
jump on this next hot thing and you know,

00:07:06.877 --> 00:07:08.785
it's not for you.

00:07:08.785 --> 00:07:09.618
So, for me,

00:07:09.618 --> 00:07:11.550
just having the discipline
and having the confidence

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.550
in who I am.

00:07:15.098 --> 00:07:17.258
You know, and if I go into a studio

00:07:17.258 --> 00:07:20.497
and if I find my truth of the moment,

00:07:20.497 --> 00:07:23.918
there are a number of people in the world

00:07:23.918 --> 00:07:25.929
that can relate to what I'm saying

00:07:25.929 --> 00:07:29.262
and is going to buy into what I'm doing.

00:07:30.866 --> 00:07:33.377
You know, not because it's
the new thing of the moment,

00:07:33.377 --> 00:07:35.909
but because it's my genuine emotions,

00:07:35.909 --> 00:07:36.969
it's how I feel.

00:07:36.969 --> 00:07:38.983
This is how I articulate the world.

00:07:38.983 --> 00:07:43.133
And you know, just having
the discipline to you know,

00:07:43.133 --> 00:07:44.133
be yourself.

